/-! # WP-N, file 5: `θ_Ψ` under change of `Γ` and under `SL₂(R)` (C5's open item 3; MATH2 §2.1 end)

* `ae_eq_zero_of_box_tests`: a locally integrable function killed by all bounded test functions on
